WEBVTT

00:04:30.141 --> 00:04:31.892
And we engage in local artisans

00:04:31.892 --> 00:04:35.104
to create our packaging
with sustainable materials

00:04:35.104 --> 00:04:36.814
that they are already working with,

00:04:36.814 --> 00:04:39.525
like woven baskets, 
clay cups and molinillos.

00:04:39.817 --> 00:04:42.486
Together, we cultivate
the cocoa from the trees,

00:04:42.486 --> 00:04:43.821
produce the chocolate

00:04:43.821 --> 00:04:45.281
and package the final product.

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:48.326
We started operations on a tiny scale

00:04:48.326 --> 00:04:50.911
in an empty room
of my grandmother’s house.

00:04:51.287 --> 00:04:55.499
In 2015, we sold
about 50 kilograms of chocolate.

00:04:55.624 --> 00:04:59.670
By 2020, we sold
over 1,800 kilograms of chocolate,

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:03.382
and our work has been recognized
by the US government,